          "text": "Mwakamvwa mbwendakamwaambila kuti, Ndainka, alimwi ndaboola kulindinywe. Kuti nomwali kundiyanda, nomwali kukondwa nkaambo nja kuli-Taata, nkaambo Taata mupati kwiinda ndime. ",
